1
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:42,370
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:47,640
[Episode 15: Until You Care]

3
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:51,710
[Shencheng First Garment Factory]

4
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,000
Ms. Xie,

5
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,000
these are our imported,
fully automatic sewing machines.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,480
They're three times
more efficient than manual labor.

7
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:57,100
And the stitches are even smoother
than handmade ones.

8
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,920
Many big factories in Shencheng
are fighting to order them.

9
00:00:58,920 --> 00:00:59,680
Mr. Chen said

10
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,770
if you have time,

11
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,130
please do meet with him.

12
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,200
Alright.

13
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,800
I will meet with him when I'm free.

14
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:05,400
Great!

15
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:10,670
Ladies,

16
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:11,850
welcome here today.

17
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:14,170
It's going to be hard work from now on.

18
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,960
Just put your heart into it
and teach them well,

19
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,600
alright?

20
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:18,610
Instead of running the business,

21
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:21,400
why bring in a bunch of old ladies?

22
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,600
What are they trying to pull?

23
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,039
The factory renovation is almost done.

24
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,560
What's the plan next?

25
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:55,120
I found several excellent seamstresses,

26
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:58,539
and a professor who returned
from studying abroad.

27
00:01:59,990 --> 00:02:01,350
I plan to

28
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:04,720
combine theory and practice,

29
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:07,140
and train our own female workers hands-on.

30
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:08,680
Well said.

31
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:12,000
Even the best machines
will become obsolete one day,

32
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,520
but people are different.

33
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,280
People

34
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:17,760
will keep growing
if they're willing to learn.

35
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,620
Machines can never replace that.

36
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,480
But then again,

37
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,079
people

38
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,560
are uncontrollable.

39
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:27,120
If we work hard to train them,

40
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:29,360
and they get poached later,

41
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:31,680
this business deal won't be worth it.

42
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,200
Isn't that a good thing?

43
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,600
I train them

44
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,840
not just for Blooming Path,

45
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,240
but in the hopes

46
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,600
that no matter where they go,

47
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,880
they can make a living.

48
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,300
They won't need to depend on anyone,

49
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,990
or act on anyone's whims.

50
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,940
How wonderful is that?

51
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,960
Chang Yongbin has been tailing you lately.

52
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,080
I'm worried for your safety.

53
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:02,760
I'll ask Biao...

54
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,960
It's fine.

55
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,000
No need.

56
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,370
Hello, Mr. Chen,

57
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:20,250
it's Xie Nanfeng.

58
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,000
I'm free tomorrow.

59
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:23,440
How about we meet in person?

60
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,520
I'll take all the machines you have.

61
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:27,640
Okay.

62
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,640
See you tomorrow.

63
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:31,680
Mr. Chu,

64
00:03:31,810 --> 00:03:33,690
play along with me tomorrow.

65
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,200
Sure.

66
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,400
What's my reward?

67
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:40,870
What reward do you want?

68
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,120
I want...

69
00:03:50,130 --> 00:03:51,250
One kiss is enough?

70
00:03:54,530 --> 00:03:55,450
What do you say?

71
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:17,800
Ms. Xie,

72
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,839
are you really buying

73
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:21,040
all 70 of our imported sewing machines?

74
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,160
Of course.

75
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:26,100
Blooming Path is
expanding production capacity.

76
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:27,180
Your machines

77
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:30,040
will only be put to good use in my hands.

78
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,560
So about the price...

79
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,620
You name the price.

80
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,520
You can spend my money

81
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:42,159
however you want.

82
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:46,680
That's great!

83
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,080
I'll prepare the contract right away.

84
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:50,740
I'll send it over
first thing tomorrow morning.

85
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:01,690
Your acting has improved,

86
00:05:01,690 --> 00:05:02,640
Mr. Chu.

87
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:05,960
Being nice to you

88
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,540
is never an act.

89
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:15,240
Sir,

90
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,440
are you short on cash?

91
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,440
Da Li Lai Loan Company

92
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,880
not only issues loans fast,

93
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:22,280
but the interest rates are negotiable too.

94
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:26,840
How much can you lend?

95
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,440
That depends on you.

96
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,330
How much do you want?

97
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,360
How much did he ask for?

98
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,220
Half a million.

99
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,520
Give him one million.

100
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,320
You know what?

101
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:46,520
Our female workers have already started.

102
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:48,159
And they're working

103
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:49,240
while training.

104
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,200
They're all very enthusiastic.

105
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,320
That's great.

106
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:56,970
Aren't you curious
who I lent the money to?

107
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,040
Got it.

108
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,440
You have so many business dealings.

109
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:13,640
There's no need to ask about all of them.

110
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,000
Xie Nanfeng,

111
00:06:16,850 --> 00:06:18,850
you really don't care at all, do you?

112
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,120
What am I supposed to care about?

113
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,040
Care about what I do.

114
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:31,160
Care about me.

115
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:36,680
Are you really not the least bit
possessive of me?

116
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,320
Why should I be possessive?

117
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:44,640
You're not my personal property.

118
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,160
What about now?

119
00:07:03,090 --> 00:07:04,950
Do you care about me a little more?

120
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,290
Then I'll stay right here today

121
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,640
until you care about me.

122
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,560
Xie Nanfeng!

123
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,480
We just got out of the red,

124
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,160
and you blow it on a new factory?

125
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,220
Who agreed to this?

126
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,960
Sitting on inventory instead of moving it,

127
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,600
and buying used machines?

128
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,320
You're not here to run a business.

129
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,210
You're here to sabotage it.

130
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,240
I propose

131
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:39,640
we dismiss Xie Nanfeng as General Manager,

132
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:40,280
before she drags us all

133
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,840
into the fire.

134
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,520
Are you done?

135
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,120
All risks from Ms. Xie's decisions

136
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,720
will be borne entirely by me.

137
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,480
If her decisions

138
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,200
cause you any losses,

139
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,640
I will buy all your shares

140
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:03,460
at three times the original stock price.

141
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,120
If there are no further objections,

142
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,930
the meeting continues.

143
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,920
Fine.

144
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,680
We're willing to bet
on Ms. Xie's decisions,

145
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,760
but we can't

146
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,040
sit on cash instead of expanding
and grabbing orders,

147
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,040
only to blow it all on female workers

148
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,820
and build women's bathrooms!

149
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,539
We barely have any orders,

150
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,330
yet we're running three shifts

151
00:08:35,390 --> 00:08:37,250
and even giving menstrual leave!

152
00:08:37,250 --> 00:08:38,730
Is this running a factory

153
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,840
or running a charity?

154
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:45,200
Do you have any idea how long

155
00:08:45,570 --> 00:08:47,230
a woman's bra actually lasts?

156
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:53,240
Bras are not fast-moving consumer goods.

157
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,440
One can be worn for over half a year.

158
00:08:55,610 --> 00:08:57,730
Once the initial hype dies down,

159
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,480
the market will saturate in no time.

160
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,320
There won't be any greater demand.

161
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,580
If you don't make bras,

162
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,160
you can pivot to something else.

163
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:06,290
We can't keep burning money like this.

164
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,160
No rush.

165
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,360
What's the hurry?

166
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,540
In a couple of days,

167
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,490
the answer will reveal itself.

168
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:29,040
Well, look who it is!

169
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,240
If it isn't Ms. Xie!

170
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:34,640
What brings you
to my humble establishment?

171
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:37,790
Wait.

172
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:39,150
Let me guess.

173
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:46,240
Is it because all the orders
ran over to my side,

174
00:09:47,450 --> 00:09:49,490
and you're feeling a bit uneasy?

175
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,040
Exactly!

176
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,360
I heard Manager Chang

177
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,720
bought some imported Japanese machines.

178
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,600
I had to learn from you.

179
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,000
Speaking of which, I have to thank you.

180
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,560
If you hadn't generously backed out,

181
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,600
how would I have gotten these machines

182
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,800
for just an extra 300,000?

183
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,160
You have no idea.

184
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,960
These machines in my factory

185
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,540
work day and night,

186
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,960
non-stop.

187
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,360
My hands are cramped from taking orders!

188
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,680
Another call!

189
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,920
Speak of the devil.

190
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:21,960
So busy!

191
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,920
You want to increase your order volume?

192
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:25,840
No problem.

193
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:28,360
Nobody's buying?
